sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ProfilePage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewOwnProfileBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewOwnProfileController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: view my profile
  UI->>B: GET /api/me (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer userId)
  C->>User: findById()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: UserSummary
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result